tected veteran status or any other applicable federal or state-protected classification. Required Documents Required Documents Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). © 2013 Marquette University, \"Be The Difference\" is registered in the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
